B.acn=new A.dR("      A card's **Will** has two functions:\n\n      - when the card is [[Summon | summoned]], collect [[Mana Counter | mana]] equivalent to this value onto the card;\n\n      - if the card is set, before it has been summoned; you can [[Sacrifice | sac]] it face-down through the\n        [[Hidden Sacrifice]] mechanic in order to pay for mana costs.\n\n      You can never get both benefits from a single card. Either it is sac'd (or destroyed) face-down, or it is\n      eventually summoned.\n      ",!0)
